      "title": "The Witchcraft Threat",
      "start_block": "B013",
      "end_block": "B034",
      "hook": "Catherine mocks Juliana's mother's book as 'weeds' and threatens to burn it.",
      "cliffhanger": "Catherine whispers that when Juliana is hanged, no one will remember what was written inside.",
      "why": "High-stakes threat of execution combined with the destruction of a character's only legacy creates immediate urgency.",
      "context_gap": "None; the villain's cruelty and the life-or-death stakes are clear."
    },
    {
      "title": "Scarred Soldier vs. Duke",
      "start_block": "B044",
      "end_block": "B056",
      "hook": "Juliana defiantly declares her husband will find her despite being dragged away.",
      "cliffhanger": "The heavy iron door slams shut, locking her in total isolation with a deafening thud.",
      "why": "Contrasts the heroine's hope against the villain's mockery, ending on a visceral sound of entrapment.",
      "context_gap": "Strangers won't know who Alexander is or why he is called a 'scarred soldier', but the promise of rescue is clear."
    },
    {
      "title": "From Grief to Vow",
      "start_block": "B059",
      "end_block": "B074",
      "hook": "Juliana collapses in tears sobbing for her mother in the dark cell.",
      "cliffhanger": "Juliana stands up, eyes hardening, vowing they will not take Alexander from her as the portcullis drops.",
      "why": "Transforms the scene from pure despair to an unbreakable vow, creating emotional investment in her survival.",
      "context_gap": "The specific history of the 'ledger' and 'locket' is missing, but the core conflict (saving her husband) remains."
    }
  ],
  "moments": [
    {
      "start_block": "B022",
      "end_block": "B024",
